--- !u!114 &7424284905135307767
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1659951525169016799}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d2b5ebe497c5e7c47aa4d34c6990129b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MangAmboModule
  defaultDialogue:
  - speakerName: Mang Ambo
    text: Hi Agos, the land and sea are always together, they have a role in each
      others cycle.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 46270cb74b6869243886adb7cd559235, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Mang Ambo
    text: There's a tale that say 4 artifacts are scattered throughout the waters
      that can grant bonuses.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 46270cb74b6869243886adb7cd559235, type: 3}
  tieredDialogues:
  - tierName: Dead Ocean
    lines:
    - speakerName: Mang Ambo
      text: My father used to say the sea was a mirror. Look at us now. We look like
        trash.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a356a4a1f8201c4683809483e4a002c, type: 3}
    - speakerName: Mang Ambo
      text: "If it\u2019s grey and oily, it\u2019s not a fish. Pull the junk out
        first, or your rod will snap."
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a356a4a1f8201c4683809483e4a002c, type: 3}
    - speakerName: Mang Ambo
      text: "The water... it\u2019s thicker with plastic than it is with life today."
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a356a4a1f8201c4683809483e4a002c, type: 3}
    rewardCoins: 0
    rewardItem: {fileID: 0}
    rewardAmount: 0
  - tierName: Endangered Ocean
    lines:
    - speakerName: Mang Ambo
      text: The tides are trying to wash away our mistakes, but we have to help them
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a356a4a1f8201c4683809483e4a002c, type: 3}
    - speakerName: Mang Ambo
      text: Be careful with those baby fish. If we take the children, there will
        be no grandparents.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a356a4a1f8201c4683809483e4a002c, type: 3}
    - speakerName: Mang Ambo
      text: Releasing a small catch today means a heavier haul next season. Think
        of the legacy.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a356a4a1f8201c4683809483e4a002c, type: 3}
    rewardCoins: 0
    rewardItem: {fileID: 0}
    rewardAmount: 0
  - tierName: Neutral Ocean
    lines:
    - speakerName: Mang Ambo
      text: "It\u2019s a fair day for a haul. Not a miracle, but enough to fill the
        belly."
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a356a4a1f8201c4683809483e4a002c, type: 3}
    - speakerName: Mang Ambo
      text: The Snappers are back in the reef. They like it when the water stays
        clear.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a356a4a1f8201c4683809483e4a002c, type: 3}
    - speakerName: Mang Ambo
      text: The Standard Rod can handle these currents. Keep a steady hand on the
        reel.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a356a4a1f8201c4683809483e4a002c, type: 3}
    rewardCoins: 0
    rewardItem: {fileID: 0}
    rewardAmount: 0
  - tierName: Thriving Ocean
    lines:
    - speakerName: Mang Ambo
      text: The color of the blue today... I haven't seen it like this since I was
        your age.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 46270cb74b6869243886adb7cd559235, type: 3}
    - speakerName: Mang Ambo
      text: "Tuna are running deep. You\u2019ll need a Steel Rod and a strong back
        for those monsters."
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 46270cb74b6869243886adb7cd559235, type: 3}
    - speakerName: Mang Ambo
      text: Heavy fish will fight. Watch your tension meter or you'll lose your bait
        and your pride.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 46270cb74b6869243886adb7cd559235, type: 3}
    rewardCoins: 25
    rewardItem: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ce783e7c3ae09bc49888d35e39b3ae34, type: 2}
    rewardAmount: 7
  - tierName: Pristine Ocean
    lines:
    - speakerName: Mang Ambo
      text: The water is so clear I can see the SeaHorses dancing in the grass. Truly
        a miracle.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 46270cb74b6869243886adb7cd559235, type: 3}
    - speakerName: Mang Ambo
      text: "You\u2019ve done it. You\u2019ve turned the tide. This is the inheritance
        I dreamed of for you."
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 46270cb74b6869243886adb7cd559235, type: 3}
    - speakerName: Mang Ambo
      text: 'In a Pristine sea, every cast is a gift. But remember: a protector never
        takes more than they need.'
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 46270cb74b6869243886adb7cd559235, type: 3}
    rewardCoins: 150
    rewardItem: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c988bdd6d1040d74c9ca4c296c720b98, type: 2}
    rewardAmount: 5
